OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance Sunday marked across
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvents and services have taken place in
OL,7,Fcities, towns and villages across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland to mark Remembrance
OL,9,FSunday.
OL,11,FHundreds of people have attended a
OL,12,Fceremony at Belfast City Hall, which
OL,13,Fbegan with a two-minute silence at
OL,14,F11:00 GMT.
OL,16,FRemembrance Sunday is observed on the
OL,17,Fsecond Sunday of November.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
