OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance Sunday marked across
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Lord Mayor of Belfast, Rois-Maire
OL,7,FDonnelly of Sinn Fein, laid a laurel
OL,8,Fwreath at the cenotaph in Belfast, as
OL,9,Fdid the Parliamentary Under Secretary
OL,10,Fof State for Northern Ireland Sarah
OL,11,FOwen and Irish government minister
OL,12,FFrank Feighan.
